{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_ca9a49cd222a4898952cf293","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Beclin Clínica Ribeirão Preto protocolo facelifting harmonização facial\"\n\nI'll perform a web search for information about Beclin Clínica in Ribeirão Preto regarding facelift and facial harmonization protocols.\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"BeClin Clinica de Estetica (@clinicabeclin)\",\"url\":\"https://www.instagram.com/clinicabeclin/?hl=zh-cn\"},{\"title\":\"Clínica Beclin | Ribeirão Prêto SP\",\"url\":\"https://www.facebook.com/clinicabeclin/?locale=pt_BR\"}]\n\nI found some information about BeClin Clínica in Ribeirão Preto. Let me search for more specific details about their facelifting protocol and facial harmonization services.\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"BeClin Clinica de Estetica (@clinicabeclin)\",\"url\":\"https://www.instagram.com/clinicabeclin/?hl=zh-cn\"},{\"title\":\"Clínica Beclin | Ribeirão Prêto SP\",\"url\":\"https://www.facebook.com/clinicabeclin/?locale=pt_BR\"},{\"title\":\"lifting facial não cirúrgico associado ao full face ✨ Melhora ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DUJsDqxkhRU/\"},{\"title\":\"Não é mágica e não é filtro, é o protocolo facelifting®️ Isso ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.facebook.com/drafrancinebianchini/videos/n%25C3%25A3o-%25C3%25A9-m%25C3%25A1gica-e-n%25C3%25A3o-%25C3%25A9-filtro-%25C3%25A9-o-protocolo-facelifting%25EF%25B8%258Fisso-%25C3%25A9-resultado-de-t%25C3%25A9cnic/1192829062836575/\"},{\"title\":\"Lifting Facial - Cirurgia plástica Ribeirão Preto\",\"url\":\"https://andreventurelli.com.br/lifting-facial\"},{\"title\":\"Rejuvenescimento facial sem cirurgia: as 3 tecnologias que ...\",\"url\":\"https://esteticaemercado.com.br/entrevista/rejuvenescimento-facial-sem-cirurgia-as-3-tecnologias-que-estao-redefinindo-o-lifting-no-brasil/\"},{\"title\":\"Resultado do Protocolo Lifting Facial não cirúrgico\",\"url\":\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DTSbmIPDiAL/\"},{\"title\":\"Resultado do Protocolo Lifting Facial não cirúrgico ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.facebook.com/EsteticaNeisaBrascher/videos/resultado-do-protocolo-lifting-facial-n%25C3%25A3o-cir%25C3%25BArgico-reposicionamento-dos-tecidos/1795380924474615/\"},{\"title\":\"Face Lift - Rejuvenescimento Facial\",\"url\":\"https://lotusclinica.com/conteudo/face-lift-rejuvenescimento-facial.html\"},{\"title\":\"LIFTING TEMPORAL NAO CIRÚRGICO associado a ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4mNddwZGy8s\"}]\n\n## Search Results: Beclin Clínica Ribeirão Preto - Protocolo Facelifting & Harmonização Facial\n\nBased on my search, here's what I found about **Beclin Clínica** in **Ribeirão Preto** and their facial lifting and harmonization protocols:\n\n### 📍 **About BeClin Clínica**\n- **Location:** Ribeirão Preto, São Paulo, Brazil\n- **Specialization:** Aesthetic clinic focused on non-surgical facial procedures\n- **Professional:** Led by a specialist with 11 years of experience, graduated from USP (University of São Paulo), with postgraduate studies in aesthetic procedures and specialization in non-surgical temporal lifting (faceLifting®)\n\n### 🌟 **Key Information About Their Protocol:**\n\n**1. Protocolo Facelifting® (Non-Surgical)**\n- Customized according to each patient's needs and desires\n- Guarantees natural results adapted to each face\n- The only exclusive treatment of its kind\n- Combines technique, knowledge, and anatomy\n- Respects patient health and delivers lasting results\n\n**2. Main Benefits Include:**\n- Reposicionamento dos tecidos da face (repositioning of facial tissues)\n- Melhora do contorno facial (improvement of facial contour)\n- Suavização da flacidez (softening of sagging/looseness)\n- Can be associated with other treatments like full face\n- Uses ácido hialurônico (hyaluronic acid) structuring points\n\n**3. Approach:**\n- Non-invasive/non-surgical approach\n- Periodic maintenance can help postpone or even avoid surgical intervention\n- Focuses on natural-looking results\n- Not described as \"magic\" or filters - results from proper technique and expertise\n\n### 📱 **Where to Find More Information:**\n- **Instagram:** [@clinicabeclin](https://www.instagram.com/clinicabeclin/) - Features before/after results and procedure videos\n- **Facebook:** [Clínica Beclin](https://www.facebook.com/clinicabeclin/) - Additional information about the protocol\n\nThe clinic appears to specialize in **harmonização facial** (facial harmonization) with an emphasis on their proprietary **faceLifting® protocol**, which is a non-surgical alternative to traditional surgical facelifts.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"baa36dbd-648f-4f8c-8614-8024e9abc230","uuid":"da6acde7-2904-4429-bbc0-f2318a44d81b","tool_use_result":{"query":"Beclin Clínica Ribeirão Preto protocolo facelifting harmonização facial","results":["I'll perform a web search for information about Beclin Clínica in Ribeirão Preto regarding facelift and facial harmonization protocols.",{"tool_use_id":"call_c03829bb403d4a5a910be7f5","content":[{"title":"BeClin Clinica de Estetica (@clinicabeclin)","url":"https://www.instagram.com/clinicabeclin/?hl=zh-cn"},{"title":"Clínica Beclin | Ribeirão Prêto SP","url":"https://www.facebook.com/clinicabeclin/?locale=pt_BR"}]},"I found some information about BeClin Clínica in Ribeirão Preto. Let me search for more specific details about their facelifting protocol and facial harmonization services.",{"tool_use_id":"call_f6cb24f2dea24c14af08c8c7","content":[{"title":"BeClin Clinica de Estetica (@clinicabeclin)","url":"https://www.instagram.com/clinicabeclin/?hl=zh-cn"},{"title":"Clínica Beclin | Ribeirão Prêto SP","url":"https://www.facebook.com/clinicabeclin/?locale=pt_BR"},{"title":"lifting facial não cirúrgico associado ao full face ✨ Melhora ...","url":"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DUJsDqxkhRU/"},{"title":"Não 