omized according to each patient's needs and desires\n- Guarantees natural results adapted to each face\n- The only exclusive treatment of its kind\n- Combines technique, knowledge, and anatomy\n- Respects patient health and delivers lasting results\n\n**2. Main Benefits Include:**\n- Reposicionamento dos tecidos da face (repositioning of facial tissues)\n- Melhora do contorno facial (improvement of facial contour)\n- Suavização da flacidez (softening of sagging/looseness)\n- Can be associated with other treatments like full face\n- Uses ácido hialurônico (hyaluronic acid) structuring points\n\n**3. Approach:**\n- Non-invasive/non-surgical approach\n- Periodic maintenance can help postpone or even avoid surgical intervention\n- Focuses on natural-looking results\n- Not described as \"magic\" or filters - results from proper technique and expertise\n\n### 📱 **Where to Find More Information:**\n- **Instagram:** [@clinicabeclin](https://www.instagram.com/clinicabeclin/) - Features before/after results and procedure videos\n- **Facebook:** [Clínica Beclin](https://www.facebook.com/clinicabeclin/) - Additional information about the protocol\n\nThe clinic appears to specialize in **harmonização facial** (facial harmonization) with an emphasis on their proprietary **faceLifting® protocol**, which is a non-surgical alternative to traditional surgical facelifts."],"durationSeconds":10.393034419999996}}
