{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_202602090352355fa12b6f58fb4c99","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-4.7","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! The site for **Beclin Clínica** has been successfully completed. Let me provide a summary:\n\n## US-082 - Beclin Clínica - Complete ✅\n\n### What Was Created:\n\n**File Created:**\n- `site-demo/beclin-clinica/index.html` (1,866 lines, ~72KB)\n\n### Design Concept: Porcelain & Gold Noir\n\nA completely new sophisticated luxurious aesthetic from all 33+ previous palettes:\n\n- **Porcelain whites**: `#F5F3F0`, `#FAF8F6` - crisp, clean backgrounds\n- **Champagne Gold**: `#C9A962`, `#D4B878`, `#E8D4A0` - luxurious metallic accents\n- **Deep Noir**: `#0F0E0D`, `#1A1918` - elegant dark contrasts\n- **Soft Rose**: `#D4A098` - subtle warmth\n\n**Typography:**\n- **Display**: Playfair Display - elegant serif with luxury appeal\n- **Body**: Outfit - modern geometric for readability\n\n**Unique Element:**\n- **Facial Contour Wave Border Radius** - organic shapes inspired by natural facial curves and facelifting results\n- **Gold Shimmer Particles** - premium floating gold particles throughout the hero\n\n### Key Features Implemented:\n\n1. **Hero Section**: Gold shimmer particles, floating contour blobs, staggered entrance animations\n2. **Problem/Solution**: Dramatic narrative with gold-accented solution box\n3. **Services**: 6 cards (Protocolo Facelifting®, Harmonização Facial, Full Face, Lifting Temporal, Bioestimuladores, Consultoria Facial)\n4. **Differentials**: 6 items on noir background with translucent numbers\n5. **Testimonials**: 3 client testimonials with gradient avatars\n6. **Contact**: Full contact form with info icons and WhatsApp integration\n7. **Footer**: Complete with social links and Pixel Alchemy credit\n\n### Technical Specifications:\n- ✅ Single HTML file with embedded CSS and JavaScript\n- ✅ Intersection Observer for scroll-triggered animations\n- ✅ Staggered animations (0ms/200ms/400ms/600ms/800ms)\n- ✅ Fully responsive for mobile/tablet/desktop\n- ✅ Accessibility: prefers-reduced-motion support\n- ✅ No generic fonts (Inter, Roboto, Arial avoided)\n- ✅ Premium stock images from Unsplash\n\n### Demo URL:\n**pixelalchemy.com.br/site-demo/beclin-clinica**\n\n### Git:\n- ✅ Committed: `9cd5565`\n- ✅ Pushed to remote\n\n---\n\n**Sources:**\n- [Beclin Clínica Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/clinicabeclin/)\n- [Beclin Clínica Facebook](https://www.facebook.com/clinicabeclin/)\n\n<promise>COMPLETE</promise>"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"baa36dbd-648f-4f8c-8614-8024e9abc230","uuid":"25bca162-9016-4435-89d1-55abd99789be"}
